 s\, questions\, and ideas. Learn from others as we talk about tools\, stra
 tegies\, and handy resources. And of course donuts! (Along with fruit\, te
 a & coffee.)\nWhether you're a design pro or simply dabble in Canva — if
  you have any interest in design or just want to learn more\, you're welco
 me!\nFacilitated by Catherine Pearce & Dave Martin.\nFree & open to the co
 mmunity. No registration required.\nRepeats the second Friday of every mon
 th\, 9:00–10:00 AM.\nHosted at The Mill — dimensionmill.org
