 ty.\nJoin Jen for a hands-on wire-wrapping workshop where you'll learn the
  art of wire wrapping while creating your very own labradorite crystal pen
 dant.\nLabradorite is a stone often associated with transformation\, intui
 tion\, protection\, and inner magic. Known for its beautiful flashes of ir
 idescent color\, it's traditionally believed to help awaken intuition\, en
 courage personal growth\, and offer energetic protection during times of c
 hange. Often called the stone of transformation\, labradorite is a beautif
 ul reminder to trust your inner wisdom and embrace the magic of becoming.
 \nYou'll learn to wrap a natural labradorite stone in wire\, transforming 
 it into a one-of-a-kind piece you can wear\, carry\, or keep close as a pe
 rsonal talisman.\nNo previous wire-wrapping experience is needed. Just bri
 ng yourself\, your curiosity\, and a little willingness to play. All mater
 ials are provided.\nCome spend an evening creating something beautiful\, l
 earning a new skill\, and connecting with the magic of labradorite.
GEO:39.1671921;-86.5334276
LOCATION:Gather Shoppe\, 116 N. Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47404
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/wire-wrapped-wonders-labradorit
 e-pendant-workshop/60168/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
