SUMMARY:Griffy Lake CLOSED for Scheduled Deer Hunt
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261113T230000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261116T050000
DTSTAMP:20261114T040928Z
UID:622o5cbop84b374cerf32numai@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261113T230000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20261104T204851Z
DESCRIPTION:<p dir="ltr">As part of its efforts to manage the deer populat
 ion and support the long-term health and diversity of the park's forest ec
 osystem\, Bloomington Parks and Recreation will conduct controlled deer hu
 nts at<a href="https://bloomington.in.gov/parks/parks/griffy-lake"> <b><u>
 Griffy Lake Nature Preserve</u></b></a> Nov. 14–15 and Nov. 21–22.</p>
 <p dir="ltr">Griffy Lake Nature Preserve will be closed to all public acce
 ss and recreational use during the following periods:</p><ul><li dir="ltr"
 ><p dir="ltr">Friday\, Nov. 13 at 11 p.m. through Monday\, Nov. 16 at 5 a.
 m.</p></li><li dir="ltr"><p dir="ltr">Friday\, Nov. 20 at 11 p.m. through 
 Monday\, Nov. 23 at 5 a.m.</p></li></ul><p dir="ltr">The closures include 
 all trails\, shoreline areas\, and the entire lake. Hiking\, fishing\, boa
 ting\, and all other recreational activities are prohibited during the clo
 sures. No watercraft may be launched onto Griffy Lake during either hunt w
 eekend.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20261104T204953Z
LOCATION:Griffy Lake Nature Preserve\, 3400 N Headley Rd\, Bloomington\, I
 N 47408\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Parks and Recreation
END:VEVENT
