DESCRIPTION:The exhibit features images of and created by refugees in Euro
 pe.&#160\; Charlotte Schmitz's polaroid images of refugees who embarked on
  the dangerous journey into Europe searching for a new home are annotated 
 by the subjects of the images\, making a collaborative form of visual docu
 mentary.&#160\; In addition\, images created by refugee children in Vienna
  express their hope for a better life.  The exhibition will culminate in a
  dramatic reading of Deborah Haber's "Moses Man: Finding Home."&#160\; Cli
 ck here for more information: https://events.iu.edu/csme/event/2476138-mos
 es-man-finding-home (https://events.iu.edu/csme/event/2476138-moses-man-fi
 nding-home)&#160\;&#160\;
