SUMMARY:Fall Photo Contest\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T120000
UID:d0bd9eebb639ba6a5b0e13b2f577ad5b@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:McCormick&rsquo\;s Creek Fall Photo Contest McCormick&#39\;s C
 reek seeks your help in gathering photos of the fall splendor at the park 
 by participating in our Fall Photo Contest.&nbsp\;The winning prize is a 2
 027 State Parks Annual Entrance Pass!&nbsp\;&nbsp\; To enter\, please send
  the following information in an email to &nbsp\; Jfiler@dnr.IN.gov &nbsp
 \;from Oct. 1\, 2026&ndash\;Nov. 14\, 2026 : Photo (attached as a jpeg\, j
 pg\, png) Participant name Address Date the photo was taken The winner wil
 l be selected by a panel of DNR staff\, and the entries will be shared on 
 the McCormick&rsquo\;s Creek Facebook page after the contest.&nbsp\; &nbsp
 \; Contest Rules: NO PURCHASE NECESSARY TO ENTER OR WIN. ALL FEDERAL\, STA
 TE\, LOCAL\, AND MUNICIPAL LAWS AND REGULATIONS APPLY. VOID WHERE PROHIBIT
 ED. 1. Eligibility: This contest is open to legal residents of the fifty (
 50) United States and the District of Columbia at the time of entry. Emplo
 yees of the Indiana Department of Resources and other companies associated
  with the promotion of this contest and their respective parents\, subsidi
 aries\, affiliates and advertising and promotion agencies as well as the i
 mmediate family (spouse\, parents\, siblings and children) and household m
 embers of each such employee are not eligible. 2. Sponsor: This contest is
  sponsored by the Indiana Department of Natural Resources (&ldquo\;Sponsor
 &rdquo\;). 3. All photos must have been created at McCormick&rsquo\;s Cree
 k State Park property.&nbsp\; 4. Agreement of Rules: Participation in this
  contest constitutes entrants full and unconditional agreement to and acce
 ptance of these rules and the decisions of the Sponsor\, which are final a
 nd binding. Winning a prize is contingent on being compliant with these ru
 les and fulfilling all other requirements set forth herein. 5. Contest Per
 iod: The contest begins on October 1\, 2026\, and the deadline to submit t
 he winter photo entries is 11:59 E.T. on November 14\, 2026. Entries that 
 are submitted before or after the contest period will be disqualified. Sub
 missions will be accepted for the duration of the contest using the online
  method only. 6. How to Enter: Online will be the only method of entry tha
 t is available\, it is available through&nbsp\;by email to&nbsp\; Jfiler@d
 nr.in.gov &nbsp\;and must follow the specific directions when filling out 
 the entry and submitting. All entries will become the property of the Spon
 sor and will not be returned. 7. Prize: Winner will be chosen by a panel o
 f Sponsor&rsquo\;s employees and will win a prize. The potential winner sh
 all be selected from all eligible entries received. The Sponsor will notif
 y the winner within two weeks of the end of the contest. If the potential 
 winner cannot be contacted within five (5) days after first contact the Sp
 onsor may select an alternate winner in his/her place from the remaining n
 on-winning\, eligible entries. The prize is: 2027 Annual Entrance Pass&nbs
 p\; 8. Winner Notification: Winners will be notified via email and announc
 ed via social media. 9. Release and Limitations of Liability: By participa
 ting in the contest\, entrants agree to release and hold harmless the Spon
 sor\, and each of their respective parents\, subsidiaries\, affiliates\, a
 dvertising and promotional agencies\, other companies associated with the 
 contest and each of their respective officers\, directors\, employees\, sh
 areholders\, representatives and agents from and against any claim or caus
 e of action arising out of the participation in this contest or receipt or
  use of prize. 10. Disputes: Except where prohibited\, each entrant agrees
  that any and all disputes\, claims and causes of action arising out of\, 
 or connected with\, the contest or any prize awarded shall be resolved ind
 ividually\, without resort to any form of class action\, and exclusively b
 y the appropriate court located in Indiana. 11. Privacy Policy: Informatio
 n collected from entrants is subject to Sponsor&rsquo\;s privacy policy. P
 hotos of the entered may be used in contest promotions and general communi
 cations\, including the DNR/State Park social media pages\, newsletters\, 
 and websites.
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, 250 McCormick's Creek Park Road\, 
 Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:https://events.in.gov/event/fall-photo-contest-mccormicks-creek-state-
 park-3192
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
