  by for hot coffee\, cold brew with flavored syrups\, hot tea\, chai tea l
 attes\, hot apple cider\, and apple cider slushies. Also on the menu: fres
 h\, locally grown salads from Morning Harvest Produce\, Mkono Charcuterie 
 Boxes\, Tell City Soft Pretzels\, Bright Side Cafe gluten-free treats\, an
 d more. Open Fridays\, Saturdays\, and Sundays to start. Hours may change
 \, so check with the farm stop.
