UID:b6e52a46b4cc0f3ef84fb0c5fe7fca20@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Step inside the pages of a songwriter’s journal and meet Aud
 rey Rose\, an 18-year-old singer-songwriter blending poetic storytelling w
 ith a cinematic pop sound. On November 15\, to celebrate her golden eighte
 enth birthday (Oct 18th)\, Audrey takes the Buskirk-Chumley stage for her 
 first ticketed hometown concert\, sharing full-band originals and reimagin
 ed covers\, intimate acoustic moments\, and the stories behind the songs. 
 Come for the music\, step into her world\, and maybe find a little piece o
 f yourself there\, too.
