X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events Livewhale 235": "https://events.iu.edu/live/events/2473086-pitch-black-an-innovation-challenge"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_livewhale_235
X-SOURCE:IU Neal-Marshall Black Culture Center
DTSTART:20261116T220000Z
DTEND:20261116T230000Z
LOCATION:Luddy Community Center\, Luddy Hall
SUMMARY:Pitch Black: An Innovation Challenge
DESCRIPTION:Pitch Black gives students the opportunity to explore entrepr
 eneurship\, innovation\, and problem-solving while addressing challenges 
 affecting Black and other minority communities and college students.  Par
 ticipants will strengthen their creativity\, teamwork\, and presentation 
 skills while developing meaningful solutions. Students will present their
  ideas to a panel of faculty judges\, receive feedback\, and compete for 
 awards.  This event is a great opportunity to connect with others\, devel
 op valuable skills\, and make an impact through innovation! Food will be 
 provided!
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Pitch Black gives students the opportun
 ity to explore entrepreneurship\, innovation\, and problem-solving while 
 addressing challenges affecting Black and other minority communities and 
 college students.</p><p>  Participants will strengthen their creativity\,
  teamwork\, and presentation skills while developing meaningful solutions
 . Students will present their ideas to a panel of faculty judges\, receiv
 e feedback\, and compete for awards.</p><p>  This event is a great opport
 unity to connect with others\, develop valuable skills\, and make an impa
 ct through innovation! Food will be provided!</p>
