SUMMARY:Latine Book Club: We Will Be Jaguars - A Memoir of My People
DESCRIPTION:Connecting through literature! Explore the world of Latine wr
 iters! Free books to first 10 IU students for each session who will atten
 d a gathering. Co-sponsored by Indiana University Student Government\, La
 tino Studies\, Center for Latin American &amp\; Caribbean Studies\, First
  Nations Educational &amp\; Cultural Center and La Casa.We Will Be Jaguar
 s by Nemonte Nenquimo is a powerful memoir about an Indigenous Waorani le
 ader's fight to protect her people\, culture\, and Amazon rainforest home
 land from exploitation and destruction.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">
 Connecting through literature! Explore the world of Latine writers! Free 
 books to first 10 IU students for each session who will attend a gatherin
 g. Co-sponsored by Indiana University Student Government\, Latino Studies
 \, Center for Latin American &amp\; Caribbean Studies\, First Nations Edu
 cational &amp\; Cultural Center and La Casa.</span></p><p><span data-olk-
 copy-source="MessageBody"><em data-start="0" data-end="20" data-is-only-n
 ode="">We Will Be Jaguars</em> by Nemonte Nenquimo is a powerful memoir a
 bout an Indigenous Waorani leader's fight to protect her people\, culture
 \, and Amazon rainforest homeland from exploitation and destruction.</spa
 n></p>
