 th: 97.3422%\;" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 99.9123%\;" colspa
 n="2"><table style="border-collapse: collapse\; width: 97.3422%\;" border=
 "1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 99.9123%\;"><p style="text-align: center
 \;"><strong><em>Outfitting IU Athletics: Hoosier Champions</em></strong></
 p><p style="text-align: left\;">                  This exhibit showcases o
 bjects from IU's championship teams and athletes\, connecting them to hist
 oric achievements in the Big Ten and the national stage. The items feature
 d in the exhibit are from the IU Athletics Sports Memorabilia Collection a
 nd feature photos and videos provided by IU Athletics and Indiana Universi
 ty Archives.                </p><p style="text-align: center\;"><strong>Da
 tes: November 14\, 2025 - October 2026</strong></p><strong><picture class=
 "lw_image lw_image29062  lw_align_left"><source media="(max-width: 500px)"
  type="image/webp" srcset="https://events.iu.edu/live/image/scale/2x/gid/4
