SUMMARY:Curiosity Lab
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261119T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261119T174500
UID:261110ghoYsjIpMESLf8ZoEF6yuA
DESCRIPTION:November Theme: Paleontology Day: Thursday Time: 4 - 5:45pm Re
 commended Ages: Designed for children ages 6 - 10\, but siblings are welco
 me. Location: WonderLab Cost: Free for Members / Free with Museum Admissio
 n Curiosity Lab is an after-school\, free play program for kids ages 6-10 
 years. Children are invited to explore\, experiment\, and engage in hands-
 on sensory activities at their own pace. No instructions\, no pressure-jus
 t curiosity-driven play. Held in WonderLab \\(or sometimes outdoors weathe
 r permitting\\)\, the space is set up for exploration with a variety of ro
 tating materials and stations. There will be one main activity/installment
 /manipulative for the month that will be brought out every Thursday. This 
 will rotate with the month and the month's theme.
LOCATION:Wonderlab
URL:https://wonderlab.org/event/curiosity-lab-12/2026-11-19/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
