UID:26111074xuvYQp6EiWfuyzqMMw0A
DESCRIPTION:Please register here: calendar.mcpl.info/event/17381489 Join t
 his book club to discuss nature-focused reads each month. You'll also lear
 n how to become more ecologically minded through activities and speakers d
 esigned to enhance our reading. This month\, join us to discuss 'The Past 
 is Red' by Catherynne M. Valente. Age 18 and up Downtown Library Meeting R
 oom 2C Please register here: calendar.mcpl.info/event/17381489 Book summar
 y: In a future where Earth is mostly drowned and only a few patches of lan
 d remain\, Tetley Abednego lives in the magical floating community of Garb
 agetown. When she discovers a new friend and a terrible secret\, Tetley be
 gins to realize that her world is far more complicated than she imagined. 
 As hope becomes harder to hold onto\, she must uncover the truth about Gar
 bagetown and her place in it.
LOCATION:Monroe County Public Library (Indiana)
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/2327789178021485/
