CREATED:20260915
DESCRIPTION:Crochet is simple you silly goose! Learn very simple basics li
 ke a magic circle\, single crochet\, double crochet and more to create an 
 adorable hat and scarf for this desk goose. Choose from an assortment of y
 arn colors and little signs to make your goose a fall goose or a holiday g
 oose. This makes a great gift for someone on your shopping list.\nJoin us 
 for our Friday Workshops! Workshops run from Friday\, September 25 to Dec
 ember 11\, 6PM to 8PM. Make sure to select your workshop date and the 6:00
  timeslot to be signed up. Your project price includes one beverage\; wine
 \, beer\, coffee\, espresso\, hot chocolate or tea (other selections are a
 vailable) Ages 15+\nSeats limited. You must book ahead. Please note that o
 ur workshops are non-refundable due to limited seating.\nYou must be 21+ t
 o consume alcohol.\n
