 ://libraries.indiana.edu/andrew-rhoda)\, will introduce you to the collect
 ion\, mechanical puzzles and the collection's donor\, Jerry Slocum. You wi
 ll learn about the various categories of mechanical puzzles and their hist
 ory. You will also see highlights from the collection on exhibition in the
  Slocum Room. In addition\, there will be a group of puzzles from the coll
 ection selected by the Curator for visitors to try as part of the tour.  N
 on-flash photography is permitted\, seating is available in the Slocum Roo
 m throughout the tour\, and the building is wheelchair accessible. The tou
 r generally lasts a little less than one hour and is open to all. No reser
 vation or RSVP is required for this free tour - just drop in!
