BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_d1087e97d4ace1c1ca2dd6336d417bea870ddac277be6d1711cbc0235aa85228
SUMMARY:TandemFest: Fundraiser for Tandem's Birth Center
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T220000
DTSTAMP:20261114T040818Z
UID:fvl8but8i8q9u4tequ7qrfb0no@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T180000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20261022T210422Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>TandemFest is a fundraiser for Tandem Community Birth Cente
 r and Postpartum House\, the Bloomington nonprofit working to open the reg
 ion's first midwife-run birth center. Tandem now has funding to finish lic
 ensing the birth center\, and this night helps get it open. Tandem also pl
 ans to share a big announcement at the event.</p><p>Doors at 6 pm. Music s
 tarts at 7 pm.</p><p><b>Live music:</b> The U-Station Agents and Time Well
  Spent<br><b>Flash tattoos (6 to 10 pm):</b> Jason Profant and Haley/Yelah
  Tattoos (Time and Tide)\, Julian/bblackhoundd (Seidr &amp\; Sigil)<br><b>
 Food and drinks:</b> Pili's Party Truck\, Erika Yochum\, cash bar<br><b>Re
 adings:</b> Women Writing for (a) Change</p><p>All ages. Tickets and donat
 ions: <a href="https://givebutter.com/tandemfest">https://givebutter.com/t
 andemfest</a></p><p>Venue: FAR Center for Contemporary Arts\, 202 S Rogers
  St\, at the corner of 4th and Rogers.</p><p>More about Tandem: <a href="h
 ttps://bloomingtononline.com/business-directory/tandem/">Tandem on Bloomin
 gton Online</a></p><p>Shared by BloomingtonOnline.com\, Bloomington's comm
 unity hub for local events\, news and businesses.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20261031T040007Z
LOCATION:FAR Center for Contemporary Arts\, 202 S Rogers St\, Bloomington
 \, IN 47404
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonOnline Events
END:VEVENT
