SUMMARY:A Trio of Fun!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261120T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261120T220000
UID:1de06cf5f57a2b0aa6cff33f03fb17b8@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:A Trio of Fun!\nThree Dances. Three Mini-Lessons. One Fun Even
 ing!\nJoin Bloomington Dance Connections on Friday\, November 20\, for A T
 rio of Fun! — a lively evening of adult dance lessons and social dancing
  in Bloomington\, Indiana!\nWe're mixing things up with three short\, begi
 nner-friendly dance lessons sprinkled throughout the evening\, giving ever
 yone an opportunity to discover new dance styles\, practice their moves\, 
 and enjoy plenty of social dancing in between.\nWhether you're brand-new t
 o dancing or have years of experience\, come enjoy great music\, meet new 
 friends\, and share the fun of dancing together!\nFriday\, November 20\, 2
 026 | 7:00–10:00 PM\nLocation: Windfall Dancers\, 1101 N. Dunn Street\, 
 Bloomington\, IN\nAdmission: $15 general public | $10 students | First-tim
 e BDC attendees FREE!\nNo partner needed. All experience levels welcome!\n
 Bring a water bottle and a change of shoes.
GEO:39.1761168;-86.52857730000001
LOCATION:Windfall Dancers\, 1101 N Dunnn\, Bloomington\, IN 47408
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/a-trio-of-fun/60176/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
