SUMMARY:KHTA Volunteers & Adopters Workdays – Nov. 21 and Dec. 19 – 9 
 am to 3 pm
DESCRIPTION:Knobstone Hiking Trail Association of Indiana Meetup\n**KHTA V
 olunteers & Adopters Workdays – Nov. 21 and Dec. 19 – 9 am to 3 pm**\n
 \n[![](https://www.knobstonehikingtrail.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/202
 60627_1545121-300x169.jpg)](https://www.knobstonehikingtrail.org/wp-conten
 t/uploads/2026/07/20260627_1545121-scaled.jpg)We have completed the rehab 
 of the KT between the Elk Creek Lake Tr Hd and the Oxley Memorial TrHd. Re
 habbed steps\, new drains\, cleared blowdowns\, and other work have made t
 he trail easier to hike and maintain. Going forward\, we will continue Nor
 th from Oxley Memorial to Spurgeon Hollow.\nDetails will be posted here\, 
 on Meetup\, and Facebook. We will meet at the Oxley Memorial Trailhead.\nF
 or Google directions click on [Oxley Memorial Trailhead](https://www.googl
 e.com/maps/d/edit?mid=1u2N0UcaZxTfObaD1HNvNKkU4XtqPnL4&usp=sharing)\nPleas
 e bring a lunch and water. We will have large hand tools\, you may bring a
 ny small tools you have such as clippers or a pruning saw. And a backpack 
 is handy to carry everything in. Instructions will be provided for those w
 ho need them. We will finish at about 3:00 pm.\nView current KHTA events a
 nd RSVP on [Meetup](https://www.meetup.com/knobstone-hiking-trail-associat
 ion-of-indiana-meetup/events/)\nJoin us on our website at [https://www.kno
 bstonehikingtrail.org/](https://www.knobstonehikingtrail.org/) and on Face
 book at [KHTA Facebook Group.](https://www.facebook.com/groups/22555861179
 53484/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/knobstone-hiking-trail-association-of
 -indiana-meetup/events/317411506/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261113T145910Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261113T145910Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
