BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events Livewhale 261": "https://events.iu.edu/libraries/event/2474394-home-away-from-home-student-life-on-campus"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_livewhale_261
SUMMARY:Home Away from Home: Student Life on Campus
DTSTART:20261123T140000Z
DTEND:20261123T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260717T152335Z
UID:20261116T140000Z-2474394@events.iu.edu__20261123
ATTACH:https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/261/width/168/height/168/crop/
 1/src_region/0,0,1800,1800/31497_StudentLifeThumbnail_1.rev.1784316196.png
CATEGORIES:Art and museum exhibitions
DESCRIPTION:Going to college offers a variety of new freedoms\, excitement
 s\, and difficulties as students make the transition away from home.  Span
 ning across four decades—1970s to the 2000s—items including scrapbooks
 \, photographs\, student papers\, and handbooks demonstrate life on and of
 f campus. From decorating dorm rooms to chasing campus ghosts\, students h
 ave always found ways to build community and make new memories. This exhib
 it highlights the student experience and the multitude of ways students fo
 und a sense of home\, identity and belonging at Indiana University.
GEO:39.171003;-86.516793
LAST-MODIFIED:20261105T162532Z
LOCATION:HERMAN B WELLS LIBRARY
URL:https://events.iu.edu/libraries/event/2474394-home-away-from-home-stud
 ent-life-on-campus
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Going to college offers a variety of new
  freedoms\, excitements\, and difficulties as students make the transition
  away from home.</p><p>  Spanning across four decades—1970s to the 2000s
 —items including scrapbooks\, photographs\, student papers\, and handboo
 ks demonstrate life on and off campus. From decorating dorm rooms to chasi
 ng campus ghosts\, students have always found ways to build community and 
 make new memories. This exhibit highlights the student experience and the 
 multitude of ways students found a sense of home\, identity and belonging 
 at Indiana University.</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>\n  University Archives\, <a href="mailto:arch
 ives@iu.edu">archives@iu.edu</a>&#160\;\n</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-COST:Free
X-LIVEWHALE-ID:2474394
X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE:https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/261/width/168/heigh
 t/168/crop/1/src_region/0\,0\,1800\,1800/31497_StudentLifeThumbnail_1.rev.
 1784316196.png
X-LIVEWHALE-REPEATS-UNTIL:2026-12-04 14:00:00
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  This exhibit features a selection of materials 
 that represents the ways first-year students made Indiana University their
  second home.\n</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-TAGS:exhibition|Hoosier Welcome|Indiana University Archives|IU
  History
X-LIVEWHALE-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
X-LIVEWHALE-TYPE:events
X-SOURCE:IU Bloomington Libraries
END:VEVENT
