DESCRIPTION:Join ILAP\, Professor Quintanilla\, and the Office for Communi
 ty\, Impact\, and Engagement for a "Just Mercy" Movie Night! Hear student 
 testimonials about how Bryan Stevenson's novel impacted their path to beco
 ming an attorney and listen to Professor Quintanilla discuss why this book
  is a pivotal teaching tool during his first-year Civil Procedure Course p
 rior to enjoying the film. Food will be provided to all attendees. Please 
 RSVP by 6PM on November 20th so we are aware of dietary restrictions.
