 the Office for Community\, Impact\, and Engagement for a "Just Mercy" Movi
 e Night! Hear student testimonials about how Bryan Stevenson's novel impac
 ted their path to becoming an attorney and listen to Professor Quintanilla
  discuss why this book is a pivotal teaching tool during his first-year Ci
 vil Procedure Course prior to enjoying the film. Food will be provided to 
 all attendees. Please RSVP by 6PM on November 20th so we are aware of diet
 ary restrictions.</p>
