DESCRIPTION:The Canopy of Lights Downtown Lighting Ceremony is a sparkling
  holiday tradition on the southside of the courthouse lawn along Kirkwood 
 Avenue.\n Be there when Santa flips the switch and turns downtown Blooming
 ton into something magical. Various musical acts and activities will take 
 place on the stage and around the square starting at 5:30pm. The Ceremony 
 begins at approximately 6:45 pm with the lighting promptly at 7 pm.\n The 
 Canopy of Lights is FREE to attend\, and the City of Bloomington is provid
 ing free metered parking throughout the downtown area all weekend! For det
 ailed information about this year's activities\, click here .
LOCATION:Canopy of Lights\, Courthouse Square\, Downtown Bloomington\, Blo
 omington\, IN 47403
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/canopy-of-lights/59195/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
