 ack craft more for the purpose of getting together and making memories…a
  perfect holiday activity complete with peppermint hot chocolate or spiced
  holiday wine.\nJoin us for our Friday Workshops! Workshops run from Frid
 ay\, September 25 to December 11\, 6PM to 8PM. Make sure to select your wo
 rkshop date and the 6:00 timeslot to be signed up. Your project price incl
 udes one beverage\; wine\, beer\, coffee\, espresso\, hot chocolate or tea
  (other selections are available) Ages 15+\nSeats limited. You must book a
 head. Please note that our workshops are non-refundable due to limited sea
 ting.\nYou must be 21+ to consume alcohol.\n
