DESCRIPTION:Sugar & Spice Gingerbread House Workshop \nIt’s cozy season
 –the perfect time to gather friends and family for the annual Sugar & Sp
 ice Gingerbread House Workshop. Choose a prebuilt kit or assemble the preb
 aked segments with your crew as you work together to design a masterpiece 
 all your own.\n The event includes hot chocolate\, coffee\, and cookies fr
 om Sugar & Spice\, a photo station\, live piano music\, and a visit from S
 anta\, who will hand out treats and pose for pictures.\n Join us for this 
 Sugar & Spice tradition!\n Pricing\n Assembled House: $75\nUnassembled Hou
 se: $60\nGiant Gingerbread Person: $35\n Sugar & Spice Gingerbread House T
 ake-Home Kits \nOrdering Information\n Available for pickup from Sugar & S
 pice Wednesday-Friday\, December 2-18.\nGuests must select their desired p
 ickup date and time in Spoonfed to view available options.
GEO:39.167703;-86.523707
LOCATION:IU Biddle Hotel\, 900 E. 7th Street\, Indiana Memorial Union\, Bl
 oomington\, IN 47405
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/annual-sugar-spice-gingerbread-
 workshops/60223/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
