DESCRIPTION:<p dir="ltr">Join Asha\, our Education Intern\, and learn how 
 to make a delicious\, affordable Nepali rajma and saag meal! Rajma are kid
 ney beans\, and this dish is a thick\, spiced curry made with onions\, tom
 atoes\, ginger\, and garlic. Saag is a cooked leafy green vegetable dish. 
 A perfect warm vegan and vegetarian recipe to share with your family and f
 riends! </p><p dir="ltr">*Vegan *Gluten Free *Vegetarian</p><p dir="ltr">
 Register in the pantry or at <a href="http://mhcfoodpantry.org/education">
 <u>mhcfoodpantry.org/education</u></a></p><p dir="ltr"><br></p>
