  supplies located in the studio\, as well as bring their own supplies/proj
 ects to work on.</p><p>  This program occurs during First Thursday each mo
 nth. It is open to everyone: students\, staff\, and the public included! T
 he group will meet in the Roehm Family Art-making Studio\, located inside 
 the Simpson Center for Education on the 2nd floor of the Eskenazi Museum o
 f Art.</p>
