X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Come spend&#160\;your Thursdays at the 
 ACC practicing your Tagalog and celebrating Filipino culture! Every Thurs
 day from 5:00-6:00 PM\,&#160\;we'll&#160\;host a variety of language-imme
 rsive events with <span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">Kenneth P. De 
 la Piedra\, EdD&#160\;</span>—(included but not limited to) language ta
 ble\, speech practice\, Tagalog tutoring\, cooking workshops—to introdu
 ce the aspects that Filipino culture has to offer. <em>Tara\, Mag-Tagalog
  Tayo!</em>&#160\;is open to everyone\, whether&#160\;you're&#160\;a begi
 nner\, fluent speaker\, or simply curious about Filipino culture.&#160\;<
 /p><br /><p>  &#160\;</p><br /><p><span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody
 ">All Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, and&#160\;educati
 onal\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all IU students and 
 other members of the Indiana University community.</span></p><br /><stron
 g>For more information\, <a href="https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12
 842788">view this event in BeInvolved</a>.</strong>
