X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_c_25e52423b2d0772255c59d0e398b655d5c121833814b7b9fc11f4ddd9cff195c_group_calendar_google_com
SUMMARY:Series on Ghassan Kanafani and Palestinian Resistance: The Dupes (
 1972) Screening
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261204T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261204T210000
DTSTAMP:20261114T040930Z
UID:1l9lqnshk586v78csqvffvao5f@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261204T180000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20261027T125748Z
DESCRIPTION:The Dupes is a 1973 Syrian film based on the novel Men In the 
 Sun by co-founder of the Popular Front for the Liberation of Palestine (PF
 LP) Ghassan Kanafani. This screening will be preceded y a short introducti
 on to Kanafani's works and the role of film in the struggle for Palestine'
 s liberation. A donation of $10 for the Sameer Project is recommended but 
 optional for admission.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261103T012650Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Redbud Books
END:VEVENT
