SUMMARY:Stinesville Christmas Bazaar
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261205T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261205T160000
UID:ff7b405bcdc87adb876896def415d45a@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:🎄🎅 Stinesville Christmas Bazaar 2026! 🎅🎄\n✨ Come
  Shop\, Eat\, Celebrate\, and Get into the Christmas Spirit! ✨\nIt’s t
 he most wonderful time of the year\, and we’re excited to invite you to 
 the Stinesville Christmas Bazaar! Join us for a fun-filled day of holiday 
 shopping\, delicious food\, festive cheer\, and community spirit! ❤️
 💚\n📅 Saturday\, December 5\, 2026\n⏰ 9:00 AM – 4:00 PM\n📍 Sti
 nesville Community Center\n7973 W Main Street\nStinesville\, IN 47464\n
 🎁 SHOP LOCAL & FIND THE PERFECT GIFTS!\nSkip the crowded stores and com
 e discover unique treasures from local vendors\, crafters\, and small busi
 nesses! Whether you’re shopping for family\, friends\, teachers\, cowork
 ers\, or treating yourself\, there’s something special waiting for every
 one!\n🛍️ WHAT CAN YOU LOOK FORWARD TO?\n🎄 Handmade Crafts & Gifts 
 – Discover one-of-a-kind creations made with love and care.\n🎁 Unique
  Holiday Finds – Find thoughtful gifts and special items you won’t see
  in every big-box store.\n🍪 Sweet Treats & Goodies – Browse delicious
  homemade treats and festive goodies.\n🛍️ Local Vendors & Small Busin
 esses – Support talented individuals and small businesses from our commu
 nity and surrounding areas.\n❤️ A Little Something for Everyone – Fr
 om holiday decorations and handmade items to gifts and everyday treasures
 \, you never know what you’ll find!\n🍳🥪 COME HUNGRY — BREAKFAST 
 & LUNCH WILL BE SERVED!\nShopping works up an appetite\, and we’ve got y
 ou covered!\nStart your morning with breakfast while browsing the wonderfu
 l vendors\, or stop by around lunchtime to grab a bite to eat!\nWhether yo
 u’re an early bird ready to get a head start on your Christmas shopping 
 or planning an afternoon outing with family and friends\, you can enjoy a 
 delicious meal while you’re here!\n🎄 MORE THAN JUST SHOPPING!\nThe St
 inesville Christmas Bazaar is a wonderful opportunity to come together as 
 a community\, support local makers\, enjoy good food\, and celebrate the j
 oy of the holiday season.\nBring your family\, invite your friends\, and m
 ake a day of it! Whether you’re checking names off your Christmas shoppi
 ng list\, searching for that perfect handmade gift\, or simply soaking up 
 the holiday atmosphere\, we’d love to see you!\n❤️💚 WHY SHOP SMAL
 L?\nWhen you shop at our Christmas Bazaar\, you’re doing more than purch
 asing gifts. You’re supporting local families\, talented creators\, hard
 working small-business owners\, and the community we love!\nEvery purchase
  makes a difference\, and every visitor helps make this event special.\n
 ✨ Bring your Christmas list\, bring your shopping buddies\, bring your a
 ppetite\, and bring your holiday spirit!\n📣 HELP US SPREAD THE CHRISTMA
 S CHEER!\nPlease share this event\, invite your friends and family\, and h
 elp us make the Stinesville Christmas Bazaar a wonderful day for our vendo
 rs and community!\nWe can’t wait to celebrate the holiday season with yo
 u! 🎄❤️\nShop Small • Shop Local • Eat Good Food • Spread Chri
 stmas Cheer!\n#StinesvilleChristmasBazaar #ShopLocal #SupportSmallBusiness
  #ChristmasShopping #StinesvilleIndiana #HolidayBazaar #Christmas2026
GEO:39.2987089;-86.6526062
LOCATION:Stinesville Community Center\, 7973 W Main St\, Stinesville\, IN 
 47464
