DESCRIPTION:Make an evening of it.\nGather your favorite women\, bring you
 r date\, or come with someone you love and settle into an evening of creat
 ivity and connection at Gather.\nCome after dinner\, choose a project from
  our Creative Studio\, and we’ll get you started. Pour a glass of wine\,
  put on some music\, and spend the rest of the evening making something be
 autiful together.\nNo reservations. No workshop schedule. Just an open stu
 dio\, a good drink\, and time to linger.\nOpen Studio Date Night\nEvery Fr
 iday + Saturday\nGather is open until 8pm
