 he beautiful Yorkshire Dales in 1946. With the war finally over\, Skeldale
  House is full once again and livelier than ever as our beloved characters
  reunite under one roof and look ahead to a hopeful new chapter where Jame
 s is excited about recent developments in veterinary medicine\, although a
  new vet in the area threatens the status quo. Packed with warmth\, humor
 \, and community spirit\, this season brings more heartwarming tales of pe
 ople and animals alike. [50 min\; drama\; English]
