DESCRIPTION:When newlyweds Polly (Jean Peters) and Ray Cutler (Max Showalt
 er\, billed as Casey Adams) arrive at the famous honeymooning location of 
 Niagara Falls\, they soon meet the provocative Rose Loomis (Marilyn Monroe
 ) and her mysterious husband\, George (Joseph Cotten). Convinced that some
 thing is amiss between the Loomises\, Polly becomes even more suspicious w
 hen she comes upon Rose in the arms of another man. While Ray initially th
 inks his bride is overreacting\, things soon take a shockingly dark turn. 
 [88 min\; film noir\; English]\nBefore the film\, we’re excited to welco
 me performer Madison Avenue for a very special introduction to celebrate M
 onroe and the conclusion of this series.
