DESCRIPTION:These shows will feature work created by graduating Bachelor o
 f Fine Arts students in IU's Eskenazi School of Art\, Architecture + Desig
 n. The BFA Thesis Exhibitions represent the culmination of each student's 
 undergraduate research in the arts. Students will work with the gallery to
  plan and install their thesis work. The exhibition will feature artwork b
 y students graduating with a concentration in a variety of studio areas: g
 raphic design\, painting\, photography\, and sculpture.Closing reception: 
 Friday\, December 11\, 6–8pmExhibition: Tuesday\, December 1–Friday\, 
 December 11.Grunwald Gallery hours: Tuesday–Saturday\, 12–4pm. Closed 
 Sunday and Monday.Exhibiting BFA studentsAngelee: Photography  Olaleye Bak
 er: Graphic Design  Lauren Brewster: Painting  Marilyn King: Graphic Desig
 n  Hayley Kline: Graphic Design  Harper Masson: Graphic Design  Kinsey Tem
 ple: Graphic Design  Nate Terrell: Sculpture  Toryn White: Sculpture
