 5
URL:https://events.iu.edu/soaadiub/event/2459428-bfa-fall-2026-thesis-exhi
 bition
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p class="p1">  These shows will feature work
  created by graduating Bachelor of Fine Arts students in IU's Eskenazi Sch
 ool of Art\, Architecture + Design. The BFA Thesis Exhibitions represent t
 he culmination of each student's undergraduate research in the arts. Stude
 nts will work with the gallery to plan and install their thesis work. The 
 exhibition will feature artwork by students graduating with a concentratio
 n in a variety of studio areas: graphic design\, painting\, photography\, 
 and sculpture.</p><p class="p1"><strong>Closing reception:</strong> Friday
 \, December 11\, 6–8pm<br /><strong>Exhibition:</strong> Tuesday\, Decem
