SUMMARY:Hoosiers: The Best Shot - Director's Cut w/ Q&A | Additional Films
  and Guests
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261208T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261208T213000
UID:aeb27d9a03eeae715d3054174e6d62c5@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:The quintessential basketball movie—and perhaps the quintess
 ential Indiana movie—returns to the big screen with a new 4K director's 
 cut. When a coach with a checkered past (a career-best Gene Hackman) and a
  local drunk (the one and only Dennis Hopper) come together to train a hig
 h school basketball team\, this small-town Indiana squad skyrockets to bec
 ome a top contender for the state championship. [114 min\; sports\, drama
 \; English]\nA Q&A with director David Anspaugh and writer Angelo Pizzo wi
 ll follow the screening.
GEO:39.168585;-86.517361
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. 7th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47405
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/hoosiers-the-best-shot-director
 s-cut-w-qa-additional-films-and-guests/60198/
