X-SOURCE-URLS:{"WFIU Community Calendar": "https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/bloomington-symphony-orchestra-the-magic-of-the-movies-meets-the-magic-of-live-music-12-11-2026-13-21-46"}
X-SOURCE-ID:wfiu_community_calendar
SUMMARY:Bloomington Symphony Orchestra: THE MAGIC OF THE MOVIES MEETS THE 
 MAGIC OF LIVE MUSIC!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261208T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261208T203000
UID:3ac0839c111c328f9fa99d1241f023e4@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/40b2
 611/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/254x143!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe3%2Fdf%2Fe1c23c034c3aba
 9dab1b8aa4351e%2Fbso-screen-ads.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Historic Tivoli Theatre\nWhat do *The Polar Expre
 ss\, Home Alone\, The Nutcracker\,* and *A Charlie Brown Christmas* have i
 n common? Their unforgettable music brings the holiday season to life!\n J
 oin us at the Historic Tivoli Theatre for **Holiday Sounds with the Bloomi
 ngton Symphony Orchestra!**\n Experience the wonder of your favorite holid
 ay movies and winter classics as their beloved music fills the Tivoli with
  the sounds of the season.\n **TUESDAY\, DECEMBER 8**\n**7:00 PM**\n **Tic
 kets:**\n$15 Adults | $5 Students\n A perfect evening for families\, frien
 ds\, date nights\, or anyone who loves the magic of Christmas music!\n A s
 pecial thank you to **Sweet Owen** for helping bring this wonderful holida
 y performance to our community!\n **Make memories\, celebrate the season\,
  and experience the magic of LIVE MUSIC at the Tivoli!**\n Get your ticket
 s today!\nwww.spencertivoli.org\nTickets: https://tickets3.agileticketing.
 net/websales/pages/info.aspx?evtinfo=1028423~da03b195-1e2d-46bb-a430-e3f36
 d620f85&amp\;
LOCATION:Historic Tivoli Theatre\, 24 N Washington St\, Spencer\, Indiana 
 47460
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/bloomington-symphony-orch
 estra-the-magic-of-the-movies-meets-the-magic-of-live-music-12-11-2026-13-
 21-46
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
