 1/src_region/0,0,3200,2133/33499_green_wall.rev.1794617105.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Come hear directly from the faculty who are teaching the cours
 es.  International Financial Governance\, Trade\, and Development is built
  for students who want to work on strategy under real global conditions\, 
 the kind that shape tariffs\, trade deals\, and supply chains. In this maj
 or you'll study global business through real cases\, learn how institution
 s like the IMF and WTO work\, and run a live trade negotiation simulation.
   Join us at the information session to learn more.
GEO:39.170002;-86.517492
LAST-MODIFIED:20261110T192424Z
LOCATION:GLOBAL &amp\; INTERNATIONAL STUDIES BUILDING
URL:https://events.iu.edu/hls/event/2479371-new-major-international-financ
 ial-governance-trade-a
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><strong>Come hear directly from the facult
 y who are teaching the courses.</strong></p><p>  International Financial G
 overnance\, Trade\, and Development is built for students who want to work
  on strategy under real global conditions\, the kind that shape tariffs\, 
 trade deals\, and supply chains. In this major you'll study global busines
 s through real cases\, learn how institutions like the IMF and WTO work\, 
 and run a live trade negotiation simulation.</p><p>  Join us at the inform
 ation session to learn more.</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>\n  hlsadmit@iu.edu\n</p>
