SUMMARY: Hoosiers: The Best Shot - Director's Cut w/ filmmaker | Addition
 al Films and Guests
DESCRIPTION:The quintessential basketball movie—and perhaps the quintesse
 ntial Indiana movie—returns to the big screen with a new 4K director's cu
 t. When a coach with a checkered past (a career-best Gene Hackman) and a 
 local drunk (the one and only Dennis Hopper) come together to train a hig
 h school basketball team\, this small-town Indiana squad skyrockets to be
 come a top contender for the state championship. [114 min\; sports\, dram
 a\; English]\n\nA Q&A with director David Anspaugh and writer Angelo Pizz
 o will follow the screening.
