 etta Carlini joins the convent in Tuscany as a novice. Capable from an ear
 ly age of performing miracles\, and whose religious visions inspire very h
 uman lusts\, Benedetta's impact on life in the convent and its community i
 s immediate and momentous. [131 min\; drama\, romance\; French and Latin w
 ith English subtitles]
