DESCRIPTION: \nLooking for a fun way to spend the evening? Join us for Gam
 e Night! Whether you’re a strategy master\, a trivia buff\, or just here 
 for the snacks and laughs\, there’s a seat at the table for you. We’ll ha
 ve a mix of board games\, card games\, and group favorites\, and you’re w
 elcome to bring your own to share.\n\nA variety of games for all ages and
  experience levels\nFriendly competition and plenty of laughs\nSnacks and
  drinks \nA relaxed\, welcoming atmosphere to meet new people\n\nNo exper
 ience needed. We’ll teach you the rules and get you playing in no time. B
 ring a friend\, bring your favorite game\, and come ready to have a great
  time!\n\nHosted by: Roller Skating Club\n\nAdditional Information can be
  found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12977883
