SUMMARY: Benedetta | Q+
DESCRIPTION:In the late 17th century\, a plague ravages the land and Bene
 detta Carlini joins the convent in Tuscany as a novice. Capable from an e
 arly age of performing miracles\, and whose religious visions inspire ver
 y human lusts\, Benedetta's impact on life in the convent and its communi
 ty is immediate and momentous. [131 min\; drama\, romance\; French and La
 tin with English subtitles]
