X-SOURCE-ID:visit_bloomington
SUMMARY:Evergreen: A Paint & Sip Date Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261211T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261211T203000
UID:62878683aafdb404526871bb8cfdb84e@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Come settle in for a cozy evening of painting\, sipping\, and 
 a little creative freedom.\nJoin Jen for a guided painting class where you
 'll learn how to create your own evergreen tree scene. Jen will walk you t
 hrough the painting process step by step\, but your finished piece is enti
 rely yours. Change the colors\, add your own details\, make it moody\, mak
 e it magical\, or keep it simple. There are no wrong answers here.\nYour c
 lass ticket includes all painting supplies\, a canvas\, and a drink of you
 r choice to enjoy while you paint.\nNo painting experience necessary. Just
  come ready to make something beautiful and have a good time.
GEO:39.1671921;-86.5334276
LOCATION:Gather Shoppe\, 116 N. Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47404
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/evergreen-a-paint-sip-date-nigh
 t/60170/
