X-SOURCE-URLS:{"On Tap Tickets": "https://event.ontaptickets.com/events/home-alone"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ontap_tickets
SUMMARY:Elf
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261211T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261211T204500
UID:aed3b9dfd5e904acecdec02dcb35d8d2@ontaptickets.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://cdn.prod.discovery.evvnt.com/uploads/eve
 nt_image/event_image/7bc0a1b5-2d10-48b0-a825-6b23d0f4fb60.png/7bc0a1b5-2d1
 0-48b0-a825-6b23d0f4fb60.png
DESCRIPTION:🎄✨ ELF ✨🎄Friday\, December 18 at 7:00 PMThe best w
 ay to spread Christmas cheer is laughing loud enough for everyone to hear!
  🎅Get ready for a whole lot of Christmas spirit\, sugar\, snow\, and 
 Buddy the Elf! 💚After accidentally traveling from the North Pole to Ne
 w York City in search of his father\, Buddy discovers that being an elf in
  the big city is a little more complicated than he expected. Along the way
 \, he brings his unstoppable Christmas enthusiasm to everyone he meets—a
 nd reminds us that sometimes a little magic\, laughter\, and believing can
  make all the difference.🎬 One of the most beloved modern Christmas co
 medies!So grab your family\, your friends\, and maybe a little something s
 weet\, and come celebrate the season with Elf on the big screen!📅 Fr
 iday\, December 18🕖 7:00 PM🎟️ Tickets just $5!💵 Cash or card
  accepted!Christmas movie season is in full swing at the MET! 🎄❤️C
 ome for the laughs. Stay for the Christmas cheer. And remember…🍝 “
 You sit on a throne of lies!” 😉Movie: ElfShow Time: Friday\, Decembe
 r 18 at 7:00 PMRun Time: 1 hour 40 minutesRating: PGBox Office opens one h
 our before shows for in person sales. ACCESSIBILITY INFORMATIONWhen select
 ing your seats for non-general admission shows\, please be aware that balc
 ony access is via stairs only. Wheelchair-accessible seating is available 
 for guests who use wheelchairs. There is no seat in wheelchair-accessible 
 seating.CONCESSIONS ARE AVAILABLEPlease do not bring any outside food\, be
 verages or drink containers. Concessions open one hour before the start of
  every show.WHAT IS YOUR REFUND POLICY?All sales are final. We do not offe
 r exchanges for other movies or performances. Tickets can be forwarded to 
 friends and family.WILL THE MET CANCEL SHOWS FOR BAD WEATHER?In the intere
 st of public safety\, shows may be postponed. Every effort will be made to
  reschedule instead of cancel.WHAT ELSE SHOULD I KNOW BEFORE ENJOYING A SH
 OW AT THE MET?The MET accepts cash\, credit\, and debit cards.
GEO:39.428027;-86.4280804
LOCATION:Martinsville Entertainment Theatre (The MET)\, 36 East Morgan Str
 eet\, Martinsville\, 46151
URL:https://event.ontaptickets.com/events/home-alone
X-SOURCE:On Tap Tickets
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ontaptickets.com/event-calendar.html
END:VEVENT
