 ays free to play\, awesome prizes every round\, and different celebrity ca
 llers from the community every time.\nWith awesome prizes up for grabs eve
 ry round and different local legends hosting each Sunday\, there’s no be
 tter way to keep the fun rolling on the weekends. Round up your crew and e
 njoy Cardinal's full seasonal brunch menu with your favorite day drinks an
 d delicious dishes. \nCome and go as you need to!\n21+\nReservations are w
 elcome\nCelebrity callers are announced weekly!
