SUMMARY:The Nutcracker presented by Studio J2 Dance
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261213T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261213T180000
UID:baad0a7c52e236df44b310f23dbd2eeb@ontaptickets.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://cdn.prod.discovery.evvnt.com/uploads/eve
 nt_image/event_image/9b9dccbf-6d9f-4af5-8ad4-258cd6a99ac6.jpg/9b9dccbf-6d9
 f-4af5-8ad4-258cd6a99ac6.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Step into a world of holiday magic this December as Studio J2 
 Dance brings the timeless story of The Nutcracker to the stage at the hist
 oric Martinsville Entertainment Theatre!Gather the whole family for a magi
 cal performance filled with sparkling snowflakes\, the charming Land of Sw
 eets\, and Tchaikovsky’s iconic score. Featuring talented local dancers 
 from Studio J2 Dance\, this classic ballet comes to life with gorgeous cos
 tuming\, captivating choreography\, and unforgettable community spirit.Per
 formance Times (Select desired showtime at checkout):2:00 PM Matinee | Doo
 rs open at 1:00 PM5:00 PM Evening Show | Doors open at 4:00 PMPlease note:
  Each performance is ticketed separately. Tickets purchased for the 2:00 P
 M show are only valid for the 2:00 PM show\, and tickets purchased for the
  5:00 PM show are only valid for the 5:00 PM show.Doors open one hour befo
 re shows for ticket and concession sales. ACCESSIBILITY INFORMATIONWhen s
 electing your seats for non-general admission shows\, please be aware that
  balcony access is via stairs only. Wheelchair-accessible seating is avail
 able for guests who use wheelchairs. There is no seat in wheelchair-access
 ible seating.CONCESSIONS ARE AVAILABLEPlease do not bring any outside food
 \, beverages or drink containers. Concessions open one hour before the sta
 rt of every show.WHAT IS YOUR REFUND POLICY?All sales are final. We do not
  offer exchanges for other movies or performances. Tickets can be forwarde
 d to friends and family.WILL THE MET CANCEL SHOWS FOR BAD WEATHER?In the i
 nterest of public safety\, shows may be postponed. Every effort will be ma
 de to reschedule instead of cancel.HOW CAN I PAY FOR MY TICKETS AND CONCES
 SIONS?The MET now accepts cash\, debit or credit cards for your convenienc
 e. Box Office opens one hour before shows for in-person sales. 
GEO:39.428027;-86.4280804
LOCATION:Martinsville Entertainment Theatre (The MET)\, 36 East Morgan Str
 eet\, Martinsville\, 46151
URL:https://event.ontaptickets.com/events/the-nutcracker-presented-by-stud
 io-j2-dance
X-SOURCE:On Tap Tickets
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ontaptickets.com/event-calendar.html
END:VEVENT
