DESCRIPTION:In Derry\, Maine\, seven young friends unite against a terrify
 ing supernatural creature that has been haunting their small town for cent
 uries. Calling itself Pennywise the Dancing Clown\, It is a monster of uns
 peakable power\, taking the form of everyone's most horrific fears. Threat
 ened by their worst nightmares\, the only way these kids can survive It is
  together. Originally adapted from King's 1986 novel as a 1990 miniseries 
 featuring Tim Curry in the terrifying titular role\, this modern update la
 unched a film franchise creating nightmare fuel for generations to come. [
 135 min\; horror\, drama\; English and Hebrew with English subtitles]
