 \, you've come to the right place\; bring your lunch and hop on Zoom as we
  show you a tried-and-true method for looking at things.  On the second Mo
 nday of each month\, join Eskenazi Museum of Art's resident Arts-based Wel
 lness Experiences Manager Keaton Evans-Black to look at and talk about a p
 iece of art from the IU museum collections using the see\, think\, wonder 
 framework.  No previous art experience necessary!
