X-SOURCE-ID:events_livewhale_234
SUMMARY:Mindfulness at the Museum
DTSTART:20261217T190000Z
DTEND:20261217T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20251219T115151Z
UID:20261119T190000Z-2344735@events.iu.edu__20261217
ATTACH:https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/234/width/168/height/168/crop/
 1/src_region/0,0,1600,1590/26244_xx2006.2_o3_2.rev.1743185388.jpg
CATEGORIES:Health and wellness
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the museum and mentally recenter by making art or j
 ournaling\, and make some time to check in with yourself!  Join us for a t
 herapist-selected art activity meant to help you feel more balanced and in
  control. No prior skills needed\, just bring your heart and mind.  This g
 roup meets Thursday from 2–3 p.m.\, excluding holidays and museum closur
 es. Meetings are held in the Atrium of the Sidney and Lois Eskenazi Museum
  of Art. Food and beverages are permitted in the atrium\, so participants 
 are welcome to bring lunch.
GEO:39.169144;-86.519739
LAST-MODIFIED:20260707T141253Z
LOCATION:SIDNEY AND LOIS ESKENAZI MUSEUM OF ART
URL:https://events.iu.edu/artmuseum/event/2344735-mindfulness-at-the-museu
 m
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join us at the museum and mentally recen
 ter by making art or journaling\, and make some time to check in with your
 self!</p><p>  Join us for a therapist-selected art activity meant to help 
 you feel more balanced and in control. No prior skills needed\, just bring
  your heart and mind.</p><p>  This group meets Thursday from 2–3 p.m.\, 
 excluding holidays and museum closures. Meetings are held in the Atrium of
  the <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-point
 er align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Sidney and Lois Eskenaz
 i Museum of Art</span></span>. Food and beverages are permitted in the atr
 ium\, so participants are welcome to bring lunch.</p>
