SUMMARY:Animal Hour at WonderLab
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261218T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261218T160000
UID:537326e97e30443548bcb06c69c76e49@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/6619
 07b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/801x801+0+0/resize/254x254!/quality/90/?url
 =http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F76%2Fb6%2Ff098b9594cad8acc
 ac726583f8ea%2Fah-logo-web-info.png
DESCRIPTION:Presented by WonderLab Science Museum\nGet closer to the wild 
 side with Animal Hour and Dive Deeper! These weekly programs let you chat 
 with WonderLab’s animal experts\, discover what it takes to care for cre
 atures from around the globe\, and meet snakes\, lizards\, insects\, arach
 nids\, and more—up close and out of their habitats.\n Animal Hour takes 
 place on most Fridays\, while Dive Deeper happens on the last Friday of ea
 ch month at WonderLab’s stunning coral reef aquarium.\nTickets: https://
 wonderlab.org/
LOCATION:Wonderlab\, 308 W 4th St\, Bloomington\, Indiana 47401
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/animal-hour-at-wonderlab-
 22-07-2026-13-51-46
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
