DESCRIPTION:Open to all ages. No experience necessary. Learn basic steps o
 f centering and throwing on the wheel. Class lasts 1 1/2 hours and include
 s instruction\, materials and use of tools for $50. Bisque and glaze firin
 g is included for one piece and $5 for each piece. A $25 deposit is requir
 ed to reserve spot. 10 wheels available. Pots are usually ready to glaze i
 n 2 weeks.Two separate Saturday sessions are available at 1pm and 3:30pm.
