BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Limestone Post": "https://seeconstellation.org/kids/annie/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:limestone_post
SUMMARY:ANNIE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261220T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261220T140000
UID:2609185F5f-OVMNEagK1cmHeMFQA
DESCRIPTION:***The Sun Will Come Out Tomorrow***\n\n**Discover the magic o
 f *Annie*\, the iconic Broadway musical that has captured hearts for gene
 rations! The timeless tale of Little Orphan Annie follows a tenacious youn
 g girl whose unbreakable optimism leads her on an unforgettable journey fr
 om a New York City orphanage to a place she can finally call home. Featuri
 ng one of Broadway’s most memorable scores\, including “It’s the Har
 d-Knock Life\,” “Easy Street\,” “N.Y.C.” and the endlessly-uplif
 ting “Tomorrow\,” *Annie* is a delightful theatrical experience for 
 the entire family. *Fun for all ages!***\n\n**“One of the best family m
 usicals ever penned.” – *Chicago Tribune***\n\nSee Constellation’s 
 website for more information\, including a detailed performance schedule. 
 Learn more and find tickets at https://seeconstellation.org/kids/annie/
LOCATION:Waldron Auditorium
URL:https://seeconstellation.org/kids/annie/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"McCormick's Creek State Park": "https://on.in.gov/mccormickscreek"}
X-SOURCE-ID:localist_mccormicks_creek
SUMMARY:Cold Blooded Buffet\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261220T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261220T143000
UID:cfc8fc3ac7318a652acbb46f2503f77e@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Hop and slither to the Nature Center to see our resident repti
 les chow down on bugs and mice. Learn cool facts about Indiana&#39\;s nati
 ve amphibians and reptiles.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Nature Center is open eve
 ry day from 9:30 am-5 pm EDT May-October. Closed on Tuesdays &amp\; Wednes
 days November-April Upcoming programs can be seen by visiting on.in.gov/mc
 cormickscreek Our interpretive programs are designed to entertain and enri
 ch folks of all ages. Children under 12 must have an adult with them at th
 e programs. Registration is not required for programs (unless stated). All
  our programs are free (unless otherwise noted). They are open to the publ
 ic after paying the park entrance fee. All our Interpretive programs are l
 isted in Eastern Daylight Savings Time. *Note that during peak visitation 
 times\, entry into our park might be delayed. The drive to the Nature Cent
 er can take 8 minutes. Please plan accordingly. If you need more informati
 on\, call 812-829-2235 ext. 2
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Nature Center\, 250 McCormick's Cr
 eek Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:https://on.in.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"On Tap Tickets": "https://event.ontaptickets.com/events/polar-express"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ontap_tickets
SUMMARY:Polar Express
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261220T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261220T154000
UID:d5fef753f84e2e933d5240fe71681de1@ontaptickets.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://cdn.prod.discovery.evvnt.com/uploads/eve
 nt_image/event_image/887c6492-8167-4bcb-a21e-7452bb326305.png/887c6492-816
 7-4bcb-a21e-7452bb326305.png
DESCRIPTION:🚂✨ THE POLAR EXPRESS ✨🚂Sunday\, December 20 at 2:0
 0 PMAll aboard for a magical Christmas adventure! 🎄🎅Climb aboard th
 e Polar Express and let the magic of Christmas carry you away!On a magic
 al Christmas Eve\, a young boy who is beginning to wonder whether Santa Cl
 aus is real takes an extraordinary train ride to the North Pole. Along the
  way\, he discovers friendship\, courage\, adventure—and the wonder of b
 elieving. ❤️🎬 Experience this beloved Christmas classic on the big
  screen!And we're making this afternoon extra cozy and festive…🧸🎄
  WEAR YOUR JAMMIES OR YOUR FAVORITE CHRISTMAS SWAG! 🎄🧸Come in your
  Christmas pajamas\, an ugly Christmas sweater\, Santa hat\, festive onesi
 e—or whatever makes you feel merry! The more Christmas spirit\, the bet
 ter!📅 Sunday\, December 20🕑 2:00 PM🎟️ Tickets just $5!💵 
 Cash or card accepted!Bring the family\, wear your Christmas gear\, and ho
 p aboard the Polar Express for an afternoon full of holiday magic! 🚂
 ✨Believe. 🎄❤️Movie: The Polar ExpressShow Time: Sunday\, December
  20 at 2:00 PMRun Time: 1 hour 40 minutesRating: GBox Office opens one hou
 r before shows for in person sales. ACCESSIBILITY INFORMATIONWhen selectin
 g your seats for non-general admission shows\, please be aware that balcon
 y access is via stairs only. Wheelchair-accessible seating is available fo
 r guests who use wheelchairs. There is no seat in wheelchair-accessible se
 ating.CONCESSIONS ARE AVAILABLEPlease do not bring any outside food\, beve
 rages or drink containers. Concessions open one hour before the start of e
 very show.WHAT IS YOUR REFUND POLICY?All sales are final. We do not offer 
 exchanges for other movies or performances. Tickets can be forwarded to fr
 iends and family.WILL THE MET CANCEL SHOWS FOR BAD WEATHER?In the interest
  of public safety\, shows may be postponed. Every effort will be made to r
 eschedule instead of cancel.WHAT ELSE SHOULD I KNOW BEFORE ENJOYING A SHOW
  AT THE MET?The MET accepts cash\, credit\, and debit cards.
GEO:39.428027;-86.4280804
LOCATION:Martinsville Entertainment Theatre (The MET)\, 36 East Morgan Str
 eet\, Martinsville\, 46151
URL:https://event.ontaptickets.com/events/polar-express
X-SOURCE:On Tap Tickets
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ontaptickets.com/event-calendar.html
END:VEVENT
