SUMMARY:National Lampoon's Christmas Vacation
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261221T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261221T204000
UID:eb8a46f7fb60e9848697618fde7a75e2@ontaptickets.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://cdn.prod.discovery.evvnt.com/uploads/eve
 nt_image/event_image/f0b28ad6-ae4a-44d2-96e0-2c529289354e.png/f0b28ad6-ae4
 a-44d2-96e0-2c529289354e.png
DESCRIPTION:🎄🎅 NATIONAL LAMPOON’S CHRISTMAS VACATION 🎅🎄Sun
 day\, December 20 at 7:00 PMIt’s Christmas… Griswold style! 😂The h
 olidays are supposed to be merry\, bright\, and perfect… right?Well\, C
 lark Griswold is determined to give his family the best Christmas ever—
 and absolutely nothing is going to stop him. Not a tree that won't coopera
 te\, not a house full of relatives\, not an outrageous Christmas light dis
 play\, and certainly not one holiday disaster after another!Get ready for 
 one of the most quotable\, outrageous\, and beloved Christmas comedies eve
 r made. National Lampoon’s Christmas Vacation is packed with unforgett
 able characters\, ridiculous holiday mishaps\, and enough Griswold chaos t
 o make your own family Christmas look perfectly normal. 😂❤️🎬 Co
 me laugh\, relax\, and celebrate the holidays with one of the ultimate Chr
 istmas comedy classics!📅 Sunday\, December 20🕖 7:00 PM🎟️ Tic
 kets just $5!💵 Cash or card accepted!Grab your family\, bring your fri
 ends\, and get ready for a Christmas celebration that definitely won't go 
 according to plan!🎄 Merry Christmas… and may your holiday be a littl
 e less Griswold! 😉Movie: National Lampoon's Christmas VacationShow Tim
 e: Monday\, December 21 at 7:00 PMRun Time: 1 hour 40 minutesRating: PG-13
 Box Office opens one hour before shows for in person sales. ACCESSIBILITY 
 INFORMATIONWhen selecting your seats for non-general admission shows\, ple
 ase be aware that balcony access is via stairs only. Wheelchair-accessible
  seating is available for guests who use wheelchairs. There is no seat in 
 wheelchair-accessible seating.CONCESSIONS ARE AVAILABLEPlease do not bring
  any outside food\, beverages or drink containers. Concessions open one ho
 ur before the start of every show.WHAT IS YOUR REFUND POLICY?All sales are
  final. We do not offer exchanges for other movies or performances. Ticket
 s can be forwarded to friends and family.WILL THE MET CANCEL SHOWS FOR BAD
  WEATHER?In the interest of public safety\, shows may be postponed. Every 
 effort will be made to reschedule instead of cancel.WHAT ELSE SHOULD I KNO
 W BEFORE ENJOYING A SHOW AT THE MET?The MET accepts cash\, credit\, and de
 bit cards.
GEO:39.428027;-86.4280804
LOCATION:Martinsville Entertainment Theatre (The MET)\, 36 East Morgan Str
 eet\, Martinsville\, 46151
URL:https://event.ontaptickets.com/events/national-lampoons-christmas-vaca
 tion
X-SOURCE:On Tap Tickets
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ontaptickets.com/event-calendar.html
END:VEVENT
