SUMMARY:ANNIE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261222T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261222T190000
UID:260918rGi5tJBZR0a3GoQW_YDX0A
DESCRIPTION:***The Sun Will Come Out Tomorrow***\n\n**Discover the magic o
 f *Annie*\, the iconic Broadway musical that has captured hearts for gene
 rations! The timeless tale of Little Orphan Annie follows a tenacious youn
 g girl whose unbreakable optimism leads her on an unforgettable journey fr
 om a New York City orphanage to a place she can finally call home. Featuri
 ng one of Broadway’s most memorable scores\, including “It’s the Har
 d-Knock Life\,” “Easy Street\,” “N.Y.C.” and the endlessly-uplif
 ting “Tomorrow\,” *Annie* is a delightful theatrical experience for 
 the entire family. *Fun for all ages!***\n\n**“One of the best family m
 usicals ever penned.” – *Chicago Tribune***\n\nSee Constellation’s 
 website for more information\, including a detailed performance schedule. 
 Learn more and find tickets at https://seeconstellation.org/kids/annie/
LOCATION:Waldron Auditorium
URL:https://seeconstellation.org/kids/annie/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"On Tap Tickets": "https://event.ontaptickets.com/events/die-hard"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ontap_tickets
SUMMARY:Die Hard
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261222T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261222T211500
UID:9ec1bea91b3dd37537fe43904cf861c5@ontaptickets.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://cdn.prod.discovery.evvnt.com/uploads/eve
 nt_image/event_image/30262365-7173-4b0d-b743-31fbc569c14f.png/30262365-717
 3-4b0d-b743-31fbc569c14f.png
DESCRIPTION:🎄💥 DIE HARD 💥🎄Tuesday\, December 22 at 7:00 PMYi
 ppee-ki-yay… it’s Christmas movie season! 🎅💥Looking for a Chris
 tmas movie with a little more action\, suspense\, and explosions? We've g
 ot you covered!Bruce Willis stars as New York cop John McClane\, who head
 s to Los Angeles hoping for a quiet Christmas reunion with his wife. Inste
 ad\, his evening takes a very unexpected turn when a group of terrorists t
 akes over the building—and John finds himself the one person standing be
 tween them and disaster.With unforgettable action\, plenty of one-liners\,
  and a whole lot of holiday chaos\, Die Hard has become a Christmas-seas
 on favorite for fans who like their holiday movies with a little extra adr
 enaline! 🎄🔥🎬 Come see this action-packed classic on the big scre
 en!📅 Tuesday\, December 22🕖 7:00 PM🎟️ Tickets just $5!💵 
 Cash or card accepted!Skip the silent night… and join us for a very loud
  Christmas! 😂🎄Yippee-ki-yay\, movie lovers!Movie: Die HardShow Time
 : Tuesday\, December 22 at 7:00 PMRun Time: 2 hour 15 minutesRating: RBox 
 Office opens one hour before shows for in person sales. ACCESSIBILITY INFO
 RMATIONWhen selecting your seats for non-general admission shows\, please 
 be aware that balcony access is via stairs only. Wheelchair-accessible sea
 ting is available for guests who use wheelchairs. There is no seat in whee
 lchair-accessible seating.CONCESSIONS ARE AVAILABLEPlease do not bring any
  outside food\, beverages or drink containers. Concessions open one hour b
 efore the start of every show.WHAT IS YOUR REFUND POLICY?All sales are fin
 al. We do not offer exchanges for other movies or performances. Tickets ca
 n be forwarded to friends and family.WILL THE MET CANCEL SHOWS FOR BAD WEA
 THER?In the interest of public safety\, shows may be postponed. Every effo
 rt will be made to reschedule instead of cancel.WHAT ELSE SHOULD I KNOW BE
 FORE ENJOYING A SHOW AT THE MET?The MET accepts cash\, credit\, and debit 
 cards.
GEO:39.428027;-86.4280804
LOCATION:Martinsville Entertainment Theatre (The MET)\, 36 East Morgan Str
 eet\, Martinsville\, 46151
URL:https://event.ontaptickets.com/events/die-hard
X-SOURCE:On Tap Tickets
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ontaptickets.com/event-calendar.html
END:VEVENT
