SUMMARY:Divorced Dad Support - Peer Support Circle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261229T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261229T203000
DTSTAMP:20261114T040818Z
UID:divorced-dad-support-jan2025@example.com__20261229
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20250125T183412Z
DESCRIPTION:Divorced Dad Support offers Peer Support Circles\, where you c
 an connect with other divorced Dads in a safe and confidential space to sh
 are experiences\, gain insights\, and find strength in a community of unde
 rstanding.\n\nWe are committed to:\n\nOpen Dialogue: Share experiences and
  ask questions to gain valuable perspectives from fellow Dads who have wal
 ked a similar path.\n\nGuidance: When requested\, receive guidance on pare
 nting strategies and self-care during this challenging time.\n\nConfidenti
 ality: Safety is built when we can trust that what we share will remain wi
 th the people with whom we choose to share.
LAST-MODIFIED:20250125T183412Z
LOCATION:3820 E Moores Pike\, Bloomington\, IN 47401
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonOnline Events
END:VEVENT
