RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270111T000000
SEQUENCE:3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/1
 1/Website-River-2-2.png
CATEGORIES:Entertainment,Literary,Special Events
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261109
DESCRIPTION:Return to Prythian for a magical evening in celebration of the
  release of A Court of Forgotten Melody (ACOTAR 7)!✨\n \nJoin us at Nau
 ghty Dog Books for a night of fun and fantasy with your fellow book-lovers
 !\n \nTickets are offered in two-tiers: \n \nHigh Fae Ticket\, $40:  inc
 ludes admission to the party\, drinks and light dessert fare\, participati
 on in games\, costume contest\, chances to win prizes\, & access to exclus
 ive ACOTAR merchandise.\n \nThe Inner Circle Ticket\, $75: includes a har
 dcover copy of A Court of Forgotten Melody (MSRP $38) and all of the eleme
 nts of the High Fae ticket (includes admission to the party\, drinks and l
 ight dessert fare\, participation in games\, costume contest\, chances to 
 win prizes\, & access to exclusive ACOTAR merchandise.)\n \nRustic Charm 
 Permanent Jewelry will also be joining our court for the evening! Their pe
 rmanent jewelry offerings are excluded from ticket price and will be an ad
 ditional cost at the event. \n \nExtra copies of A Court of Forgotten Mel
 ody will be available for purchase at the event while supplies last.\n \n
 Please note: This event is 21+\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261109
LOCATION:\, 76 1/2\, E Main St\, Nashville\, IN 47448\, USA
ORGANIZER;CN="Naughty Dog Books":MAILTO:
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/a-court-of-midnight-and-magic-a-midnigh
 t-release-party-for-acotar-7/
X-SOURCE:Brown County Events
END:VEVENT
