X-SOURCE-ID:limestone_post
SUMMARY:FroMoMoFo 20 miler & 10 mile fun run
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270117T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270117T093000
UID:261031axsLW3YIa0y6QdxgPjMHEw
DESCRIPTION:It’s happening. A smaller and even more fun version of the O
 G MoMoFo but winterized. It’s the FroMoMoFo \\(Frozen Morgan Monroe Fore
 st\\) 20 miler and 10 mile run. You choose your wintery fun with either on
 e loop or two loops of the incredibly scenic Three Lakes loop trail. The t
 wo aid stations will be welcoming you with fireplaces blazing and all the 
 goodies you would expect for a trail event. This event will be held only d
 uring the daylight hours\, so no extra planning/training needed.  \n\nCome
  join the forest winter wonderland and lets make this a trail party….Woo
 Hoo!  \n\nFree hugs!!
LOCATION:Morgan-Monroe State Forest fire headquarters
URL:https://indyrunners.org/view-race-details/fromomofo-20-miler-10-mile-f
 un-run/
