DESCRIPTION:Meet at the trailhead on West Tapp Road\, just east of South W
 eimer Road. The walk will range from 1.5 to 2.5 miles\, with benches along
  the way. Friendly dogs are welcome. To be sure of location and time\, ple
 ase email Cindy Houston (cahoust@aol.com) the day before a walk you would 
 like to join so you can be added to the group text.
