 professional network in Washington\, D.C.? Drop by to learn more about the
  Hamilton Lugar School D.C. Global Policy Program (https://hls.indiana.edu
 /careers/dc-global-policy-program/index.html) for Summer 2027.This in-pers
 on informational session provides an overview of the program's structure\,
  academic tracks\, and application timeline. Attendees will discover how t
 he program connects students to hands-on experiences\, professional mentor
 ship\, and career pathways in the nation's capital.Session Highlights &amp
 \; Important Dates:Program Term: Summer 2027 (runs approximately May 27 
 – July 17\, 2027).Priority Application Deadline: Monday\, February 15\, 
 2027.Who Should Attend: Motivated undergraduates and graduate students int
 erested in foreign policy\, international affairs\, public service\, and D
 .C. career opportunities.Q&amp\;A Session: Learn about housing\, program e
 xpectations\, and course integration options directly from program staff.
