SUMMARY:3rd Annual Bloomington Winter Blues Fest 2027
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270206T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270206T203000
UID:20270206-3rd-annual-bloomington-winter-@buskirkchumley.org
DESCRIPTION:3rd Annual Bloomington Winter Blues Fest 2027\nDoors: 6:00 PM 
 / Show: 6:30 PM\n@ Buskirk-Chumley Theater\n\nMore info: https://buskirkch
 umley.org/events/3rd-annual-bloomington-winter-blues-fest-2027-february-6-
 2027
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 4
