 nzw1h1" data-markjs="true" data-ogac="" data-ogab="" data-ogsc="" data-ogs
 b="" data-ogsbtc="" data-ogsbrc="" data-ogsbbc="" data-ogsblc="">writing</
 span> through close looking and conversation.&#160\;Whether you're a write
 r or simply curious to try something new\, you'll find inspiration here an
 d a welcoming community to share the journey.</p><h3>  What to Bring</h3><
 ul><li>your favorite pencil (no pens).  </li><li>a notebook or paper. Clip
 boards are available to borrow.  </li><li>a phone or camera to take a pict
 ure of the art for later reference.  </li></ul><h3><strong><span data-cont
