 ntrast="none">where to find us\, where to park\, accessibility\, and museu
 m guidelines</span></a><span data-contrast="none">.</span></li></ul><h3><s
 trong>About Your Facilitator</strong></h3><p>  Dedaimia Whitney earned an 
 MFA in fiction from Indiana University under the direction of Scott Russel
 l Sanders. She taught creative writing at Franklin College for many years.
  She has served the museum as a docent since 2019. Her favorite works of a
 rt are those that are both visually stimulating and thought-provoking.</p>
