UID:20270212-marie-faustin-s-comedy-attic-debut-1900
DESCRIPTION:Marie Faustin is an NYC-based comedian and actress known for h
 er storytelling skills\, lightning-fast crowd work\, and ability to turn a
  bad date into a good story. She's been featured in The New York Times \, 
 GQ Magazine \, The Moth \, HBO's The Damn Michael Che \, Ziwe and more. Ma
 rie is a crowd favorite at London's Soho Theater and regularly performs fo
 r international audiences at the world-famous Comedy Cellar in NYC. Marie 
 co-hosts the popular weekly podcast MESS and has also appeared on podcasts
  like Las Culturistas\, Inside the Closet\, Girls Gotta Eat\, and more. Sh
 e's currently hosting a dating game show called Why Are You Single? to fig
 ure out what exactly is wrong with us all.
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, 123 S Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/392414
